12 lists; the last one's outcomes arrive April 2027
every night    the job asks whether a list is due
every Monday   the monitoring page, read in five minutes
every quarter  the impact page: arms balanced, nobody held
               out was called; no verdict before its time
every January  the model card and the brief, reread and
               re-signed; the calendar for the next year
